{#
   The Chairman's Terminal — hero widget, replaces the phone screenshot carousel.
   Now the "Boardroom Incident & Consequence Feed": a categorized ticker dramatizing
   the "you're the chairman, not the gaffer" pitch with real dressing-room fallout,
   boardroom equity dilution, commercial covenant risk, standout players, and
   community sentiment — on top of the original pyramid/spend/attendance feed.

   Real, live data only (refreshed by app:telemetry:generate) — no illustrative/
   placeholder filler. Previously padded with six static sackings/boardroom-clash/
   contract-dispute/youth-intake lines with no backing data; removed by product
   decision so every line shown is real — that constraint governs every category
   added here too. See LiveTelemetryService for exactly how each is built:
     - telemetry.fixturesSimulated / getCapitalDeployedFormatted() / getResultsFormatted() /
       activeClubs / weeksPlayed — aggregated from recent SyncRecord payloads.
       weeksPlayed is sync count * 4 (each sync ~= 4 on-device weekly ticks) — an
       approximation, not a true weeks-elapsed count.
     - telemetry.getDilutionPercentFormatted()/getDilutionCounterpartyFormatted() and
       getCovenantFalloutCompactFormatted() — the redesigned 3rd/4th stat boxes: the
       most notable investor_income equity event this window, and active
       commercial-covenant count paired with dressing-room fallout count. Each box's
       big pixel-font value is kept short (a percentage, or "N / N") with the
       descriptive text in the smaller sub-line — a full sentence in the pixel font
       wraps and overflows the box.
     - telemetry.recentEvents — up to 18 merged, newest-first items across 7 real
       sources: pyramid promotion/relegation/title (SeasonRecord), boardroom outlay
       (top ledger spend), turnstile attendance, dressing-room rift (resolved
       excursions[] with friction), boardroom dilution (investor_income ledger +
       matching promises[] contracts), commercial covenant risk (active promises[]
       with a league-position/tier termination clause), and talisman/community
       highlights (playerStats[]/fixtures[] outliers, fan_initiative spend, extreme
       fan sentiment). Each item carries {time, text, category, categoryLabel, club,
       detail, amountExact, timestampIso, meta} — the enriched fields feed the
       incident inspector modal (see _incident_modal.html.twig / landing.js).
#}
<div class="terminal">
    <div class="terminal-header">
        <div class="terminal-header-live">
            <span class="terminal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="pixel">LIVE TELEMETRY // 24H PYRAMID FEED</span>
        </div>
        <span class="terminal-sync vt">SYNC: ACTIVE [REFRESHED {{ telemetry.generatedAt|date('H:i') }}]</span>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-stats">
        <div class="terminal-stat">
            <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Fixtures &amp; Form</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-val">{{ telemetry.fixturesSimulated|number_format }}</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">{{ telemetry.getResultsFormatted() }} (W-D-L)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-stat">
            <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Capital Deployed</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-val" style="color:var(--mint);">{{ telemetry.getCapitalDeployedFormatted() }}</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">Transfers &amp; Infra</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-stat">
            <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Boardroom Dilution</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-val" style="color:var(--gold);">{{ telemetry.getDilutionPercentFormatted() }}</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">{{ telemetry.getDilutionCounterpartyFormatted() }}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-stat">
            <span class="terminal-stat-label pixel">Covenants &amp; Fallout</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-val" style="color:var(--red);">{{ telemetry.getCovenantFalloutCompactFormatted() }}</span>
            <span class="terminal-stat-sub vt">Covenants / Fallout</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-feed" aria-live="off">
        {% for event in telemetry.recentEvents %}
            <div class="terminal-feed-item{{ loop.first ? ' active' }} vt cat-{{ event.category|lower }}"
                 tabindex="0" role="button"
                 data-category-label="{{ event.categoryLabel }}"
                 data-club="{{ event.club }}"
                 data-detail="{{ event.detail }}"
                 data-amount="{{ event.amountExact }}"
                 data-timestamp="{{ event.timestampIso }}"
                 data-meta="{{ event.meta|json_encode|e('html_attr') }}">
                <span class="terminal-feed-category pixel">{{ event.categoryLabel }}</span>
                <span class="terminal-feed-line"><span class="terminal-feed-time">[{{ event.time }}]</span> {{ event.text }}</span>
            </div>
        {% else %}
            <div class="terminal-feed-item active vt">No activity to report in the last 24 hours.</div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-footer vt">
        <span>{{ telemetry.activeClubs }} ACTIVE CLUBS // {{ telemetry.weeksPlayed }} WEEKS PLAYED // OFFLINE-FIRST ENGINE</span>
        <a href="#download" class="terminal-cta pixel" id="terminal-cta">[ TAP TO ENTER THE BOARDROOM ]</a>
    </div>
</div>
